data: {"id": "a070afdf70b84e2b-final", "run_id": "a070afdf70b84e2b", "seq": 376, "ts_ms": 1789137721178, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v09/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Application configuration file '/input/app.conf' is missing from the expected volume mount path, causing the Python application to throw a FileNotFoundError and exit with code 1, resulting in CrashLoopBackOff. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | BackOff 13s (x134 over 29m) kubelet Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v09(5746c496-b67c-4906-aabb-e71359674305) | 确认应用容器 `app` 已陷入频繁重启循环 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | last_terminated_reason: Error; last_exit_code: 1 | 确认进程非正常退出且退出码为 1 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | Traceback: `File \"<string>\", line 1, in <module>` → `from pathlib import Path; print(Path('/input/app.conf').read_text())` | 直接定位到 Python 代码中读取配置文件失败 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | container.waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff; container.waiting_message: back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app | 确认 K8s 调度器因频繁崩溃而停止立即重启 |\n\n**证据互证分析：**\nKubernetes Event 显示 29 分钟内发生 134 次 BackOff，与 Logging 中捕获的 `Traceback` 完全吻合，表明 `read_text()` 调用失败导致的进程崩溃是高频重复发生的确定性事件。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用配置 '/input/app.conf' 缺失 → 读取文件抛出 FileNotFoundError (exit code 1) → K8s 触发 CrashLoopBackOff → 应用持续重启\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：应用程序在启动阶段尝试读取 `/input/app.conf` 配置文件，但由于该文件在预期的挂载卷路径中不存在，导致 Python 抛出 `FileNotFoundError` 并终止运行（退出码 1）。\n\n**证据引用**：\n*   **日志直接证据**：事实 `fact-346fe73ee149` 至 `fact-36022192a035` 中的 Traceback 明确指出错误发生于 `Path('/input/app.conf').read_text()`。\n*   **状态印证**：事实 `fact-f41d07cd9e6a` 显示容器退出码为 `1`，事实 `fact-8eaef07f743a` 显示 `BackOff` 事件，符合文件缺失导致应用崩溃的典型特征。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 13.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 44.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v09/workload: 44.6s (Evidence 38.5s, RCA 6.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v09/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 66.659, "metrics": {"run_id": "a070afdf70b84e2b", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 66.66573214530945, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 66665.73214530945, "llm_calls": 17, "llm_duration_ms": 55812.9096031189, "tool_calls": 20, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 19, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 15038.684844970703, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 10